{"id":"9eb892326a2bbfdc85d72d3bfd978bc66a91bdd9","axis":"silent","repo":"hibernate/hibernate-orm","sha":"9eb892326a2bbfdc85d72d3bfd978bc66a91bdd9","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"documentation/src/main/asciidoc/userguide/chapters/pc/PersistenceContext.adoc","lines":["@@ -309,6 +309,48 @@ include::{extrasdir}/pc-where-collection-query-example.sql[]"," ----"," ===="," ","+[[pc-to-one-restrictions]]","+==== Restrictions on to-one associations","+","+`@SQLRestriction` and `@Filter` may also be declared on a `@ManyToOne` or `@OneToOne` field or getter:","+","+[source,java]","+----","+@ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY)","+@SQLRestriction(\"active = true\")","+Person approver;","+","+@ManyToOne(fetch = FetchType.LAZY)","+@Filter(name = \"activePerson\", condition = \"active = :active\")","+Person reviewer;","+----","+","+The filter must have a corresponding `@FilterDef` with an `active` parameter.","+Enable it and set its parameter before loading the owner:","+","+[source,java]","+----","+session.enableFilter(\"activePerson\").setParameter(\"active\", true);","+----","+","+The conditions apply to the target entity through the annotated association, including associations","+mapped using `@JoinTable` and inverse one-to-one associations. Applicable conditions on the target entity","+and the association are combined using `AND`. Association filters apply whenever enabled, regardless of","+`@FilterDef.applyToLoadByKey`. Entity-level filters retain their usual load-by-key rules.","+Filter default conditions and explicit `@SqlFragmentAlias` declarations work as for collections.","+Use explicit aliases for filters referring to other tables of a target mapped with `JOINED` inheritance","+or `@SecondaryTable`. SQL restrictions qualify mapped columns from these tables automatically.","+","+An excluded target is represented as null, even if the target is already managed or cached.","+Other associations and direct lookups may still return the same target. Hibernate preserves the stored","+foreign key and join-table row when unrelated fields change or null is assigned to an already hidden","+association. Assigning a new nonnull target replaces the reference. A hidden target is not orphan-removed.","+Merge assumes that the detached source was loaded under the same filters and parameter values.","+","+Changing filters does not reinterpret already loaded associations. Refresh or reload the owner to obtain","+a new view. These predicates affect loading, not validation of newly assigned targets.","+Native result mappings require an additional visibility query when the association has an applicable restriction.","+"," [[pc-where-join-table]]"," ==== `@SQLJoinTableRestriction`"," ","@@ -455,7 +497,7 @@ include::{example-dir-pc}/FilterTest.java[tags=pc-filter-resolver-Account-exampl"," "," [IMPORTANT]"," ====","-Filters apply to entity queries, but not to direct fetching, unless otherwise configured using the `applyToLoadByKey` flag","+Filters declared on an entity apply to entity queries, but not to direct fetching, unless otherwise configured using the `applyToLoadByKey` flag"," on the `@FilterDef`, that should be set to `true` in order to activate the filter with direct fetching."," ===="," "],"additions":43,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/annotations/Filter.java","lines":["@@ -14,13 +14,13 @@"," import static java.lang.annotation.RetentionPolicy.RUNTIME;"," "," /**","- * Specifies that an entity or collection is affected by a named","- * filter declared using {@link FilterDef @FilterDef}, and allows the","- * {@linkplain FilterDef#defaultCondition default filter condition}","- * to be overridden for the annotated entity or collection role.","+ * Specifies that the annotated entity, collection, or to-one association is","+ * affected by a named filter declared using {@link FilterDef @FilterDef}, and","+ * allows the {@linkplain FilterDef#defaultCondition default filter condition}","+ * to be overridden 